ibsWP53MR8fvQa9tFHEkDQ6oe2UiNtUwF_CtxYZt9oeVK7ot8ynR1-io839U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQHbgavDwsQdUr7VuyCGRo9Gan9y4lR_cr1kpmoz85rnA&oe=6B01D9B6"}, {"file_name": "screen14.png", "id": "960618070340799", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313072_960618073674132_4164489290624296768_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_qs0xBMOiaQQ7kNvwEkG64N&_nc_oc=Adq5YAnel8JidajtWsH_e8vOhXezgq1aBGJvESF0hIH8yKaIpw1H0omsrihE8ESX9Kg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSe--8D3rbzXKD2j2eALYqf1_lgbeflTdwiLkl6QuKS_Q&oe=6B01ED12"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BioSuite Virtual: The World of Biotech", "keywords": ["BioSuite", "Virtual", "Training", "Acedemic", "BioManufacturing"], "long_description": "# The World of Biomanufacturing\nTake your first step toward BioSuite Virtual. This short, immersive primer is not a full course on its own, but an on-ramp to hands-on biomanufacturing training. In one focused experience, it introduces the environments, concepts, terminology, and workflows used throughout BioSuite Virtual, helping the equipment and training tasks feel familiar before you begin.\n\n# How It Prepares You for BioSuite Virtual\n- Introduces the environment where your training will take place\n- Teaches the concepts and vocabulary used throughout BioSuite Virtual\n- Builds confidence so you are ready to start hands-on training", "short_description": "This immersive introduction prepares users for their upcoming BioSuite Virtual training by introducing the basics of working in a mixed reality environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://biosuitevirtual.com/privacy/world-of-biotech", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Prism Immersive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://biosuitevirtual.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating":